				<r3d:remarks>The National Virtual Observatory (NVO) project http://www.us-vo.org/ established the foundations for the
Virtual Astronomical Observatory. The US Virtual Astronomical Observatory (VAO) is the VO effort based in the US, and it is one of many VO projects currently underway worldwide.  The primary emphasis of the VAO is to provide new scientific research capabilities to the astronomy community.  Thus an essential component of the VAO activity is obtaining input from US astronomers about the research tools that are most urgently needed in their work, and this information will guide the development efforts of the VAO.</r3d:remarks>
